LPL unification description

  specification description

    part Vars	of sort list[identifier]
	 	import sigSyntax
    part Ops	of sort list[pair[identifier,int]]
	 	import sigSyntax
  end

  query 	of sort constraint
         	result of sort constraint
	 	import unification[Vars,Ops]
			constraint[Ops,Vars]
			termCommons[Ops,Vars]
//         	start with (unify) query 
//         	start with (unify) g(x) = g(a)
		start with (unify) f(x,f(y,x))=f(a,f(f(z,f(u,v)),u)) 
//         	start with (matchs) query 
end

